00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:29.870
increase the overall
observability

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:31.490
of your cloud workloads.

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:34.400
Now, the Stackdriver
query notation

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:37.560
is built on a
